tools.description:
The next public holidays of a country from today, with how many days away.
Use when: "when is the next holiday in Japan?", "next long weekend in France".
Example: {"country":"Japan","limit":3}

Says whether a date is a public holiday in a country (and whether nationwide or regional), with the holiday's name.
Use when: deciding if offices, banks or schools are closed on a given day.
Example: {"country":"BE","date":"2026-11-11"}
